* ''[http://books.google.com/books?id=JFpYAAAAMAAJ&pg=PA647&dq=Brosy+brose&lr=&ei=-HD8St2oBJ_4lATWzNiEDw#v=onepage&q=Brosy%20brose&f=false brose]'', American Encyclopedic Dictionary, by Robert Hunter, John Alfred Williams, Sidney John Hervon Herrtage, 1897.

